  "description": "Given a non-negative integer c, decide whether there are two integers a and b such that a^2 + b^2 = c.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "1. let left = 0\n2. let right = floor(sqrt(c))\n3. while left <= right:\n4.   let sum = left*left + right*right\n5.   if sum == c: return true\n6.   if sum < c: left++\n7.   else: right--\n8. return false",
